  "releaseNotes": "- Add Python process output callback for real-time progress feedback (stdout/stderr streaming with tqdm support)\n- Reduce client request memory spike by avoiding large intermediate JSON/base64 strings\n- Fix offline wheels auto-detection (avoid --no-index when only placeholder exists)\n- Fix CPU mode where upstream infer may still call .cuda() (redirect CUDA calls to CPU)\n- Always overwrite extracted local server script to avoid stale cached behavior\n- Add one-click API (DeepSeekOcr2/DeepSeekOcr2Session)\n- Add netstandard2.0 target framework\n- Add Windows auto Python+pIP bootstrap (portable python download)\n- Fix Windows embeddable Python missing venv (fallback to non-venv pip installs)\n- Add config template as contentFiles with copy-to-output",
